+of the play, a sixth of rp_fmul_asm's 3.7%, most of __adddf3's 0.9%); its
+own FIXME asks for "integer tests". Ours: the planes as 2.30 normals and
+the eye as 16.16 made once a frame, each node's box corners read by their
+float bits (rp_fixq: no helper call; the map's boxes are whole numbers),
+the tests as three 64-bit multiply-adds. The rounding (under 2^-13 units)
+is met by a margin of 2^-12 on the safe side: a node is culled only when
